---
/**
 * Simple demo home (content.config-only CMS).
 * Cover optimization: see /posts/hello (Astro `<Image>` via schema `image()`).
 */
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Astro Dev CMS — simple demo</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>Astro Dev CMS — simple demo</h1>
			<p>
				Schema-first fixture: native <code>content.config</code> +
				<code>cms()</code>, no overlay. Dev route <code>/cms</code>.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="/cms"><strong>/cms</strong></a> — collections → entries →
					stock editors
				</li>
				<li><a href="/cms/api/ok">/cms/api/ok</a> — API heartbeat</li>
				<li><a href="/cms/api/collections">/cms/api/collections</a></li>
				<li>
					<a href="/cms/api/collections/posts">/cms/api/collections/posts</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="/cms/api/collections/posts/hello"
						>/cms/api/collections/posts/hello</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="/posts/hello"><strong>/posts/hello</strong></a> — real Astro
					preview with optimized cover (ADR-0013 / 0015)
				</li>
				<li>
					<code>PUT</code> invalid → 400; <code>DELETE</code> → 204 (allowlist
					deny covered by contract tests)
				</li>
			</ul>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
